  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep vegetables: Preheat the oven to 200C. Bring 1L (4 cups) salted water to the boil in a medium saucepan for the rice. Trim the cauliflower, then cut the head into small florets and coarsely chop the stem. Peel the carrots, halve lengthwise, then cut into 2cm-wide chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/58326/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_01-3c5e09c19014ea60abcdf05ac61091d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast vegetables: Put the cauliflower and carrot in a roasting pan. Combine the Goan-style curry paste, 2 tbs olive oil and 2 tsp red or white wine vinegar in a small bowl. Season with salt and pepper. Drizzle over the vegetables, toss to coat, then roast for 18-20 mins until the vegetables are tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/58327/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_02-2926580d9bbc8c56d65fa9aea6b809f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: Meanwhile, cook the rice in the pan of boiling water for 12 mins or until tender. Drain, cover to keep warm and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/58328/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_03-a49ec27f5bf99ddf4ba0511d16af9859.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add raisins: Remove the roasted vegetables from the oven. Add the raisins and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/58329/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_04-bc759d4f4e2c78354fd94ba1a59b85a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the rice and Goan roasted vegetables among plates and dollop with the yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/58330/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_05-5a7a1690f603c65ff6737795493d279d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Add another dimension to this flavour-packed dish by scattering with chopped coriander to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/58331/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_HACK-4d24763fbe97269c0089cc30f420a7fa.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
